- **`versionNumber` build segment = `NEXT`** on each package so build numbers auto‑increment on every `sf package version create`.
- **Dependency builds use `.LATEST`** (e.g. `3.2.0.LATEST`, `1.4.0.LATEST`) so CI picks the newest build of the targeted version regardless of whether it has been promoted/released.
